PostgreSQL: SELECT SUM(DISTINCT "amount_cents") AS "aggregate" FROM (SELECT * FROM "deals" ORDER BY "title" ASC LIMIT $1) AS "aggregate_table"
  values: [U64(10)]
MySQL: SELECT SUM(DISTINCT `amount_cents`) AS `aggregate` FROM (SELECT * FROM `deals` ORDER BY `title` ASC LIMIT ?) AS `aggregate_table`
  values: [U64(10)]
SQLite: SELECT SUM(DISTINCT "amount_cents") AS "aggregate" FROM (SELECT * FROM "deals" ORDER BY "title" ASC LIMIT ?) AS "aggregate_table"
  values: [U64(10)]
